  (text "LM567 TONE DECODER — THE HEART. NO CAPS on LFIL/OFIL (DNP pads only): the loop chatters at audio rate. THIS IS THE VOICE. DO NOT FIT."
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)))
    (uuid e7d33bff-0d2d-4b1d-b9fe-f745755d1f07)
  )
  (text "C41/C42: DO NOT FIT. Pads exist only for taming experiments."
    (at 115.57 78.74 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)))
    (uuid a82d5a39-bbae-491f-ac76-5dd4bd4999d6)
  )
  (text "Q open-collector node: R16 100k pull-up to V567 (weak = lopsided square, original behavior). C43 makes the sim stray-C explicit."
    (at 154.94 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)))
    (uuid a79fa9e9-2273-4c0b-8275-0d0b8e6c74c3)
  )
  (text "FREQ: U7 OTA emulates the timing resistor. Pin5 square -> attenuator -> OTA -> current into CT node; Iabc (FREQ_CV) sweeps f0 over decades."
    (at 25.4 96.52 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)))
    (uuid 053582f1-2846-4dc7-bde5-b62459ba271f)
  )
  (text "R38 100k floor keeps the VCO alive at Iabc=0. NOTE: 100k is outside the 2k-20k documented RT range -"
    (at 25.4 100.33 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)))
    (uuid e3fb5442-5406-478a-b032-7cd08be119eb)
  )
  (text "OTA-off f0 accuracy/drift unspecified (fine: floor only). Mux rON adds ~3.6*rON/Reff timing error - firmware cal per range."
    (at 25.4 104.14 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)))
    (uuid 5bc68399-926f-4af3-9633-904ef966e7be)
  )
  (text "CT range select: CD4052B (on V567 rail) picks 1 of 4 caps. 47n/1u/22u/470u x OTA sweep covers 0.2Hz-6kHz+ with overlap."
    (at 154.94 96.52 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)))
    (uuid f32c8f92-4e47-4215-aa1a-a6a02bec70f4)
  )
  (text "Address lines level-shifted 3.3V->V567 by Q2/Q3 (inverting - firmware flips bits)."
    (at 154.94 100.33 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)))
    (uuid 49f6f867-efa5-4aa1-b076-5c9cd0556494)
  )

